1586,"is_external_url":49},121009265252228,"/__replay/source/a.storyblok.com/f/337048/2048x1152/27767b7d5e/single-pane.jpg",{},"A Single Pane of Glass for All Yards","Other systems manage sites one by one. \nTerminal delivers an enterprise-wide dashboard where all yards are connected, digitized, and automated. Managers can toggle across sites, compare performance, and standardize best practices — creating network-level efficiency.",{"_uid":1590,"image":1591,"title":1595,"content":1596,"component":1580},"68f84f59-0d4b-4365-ab42-67f9ed44c7fb",{"id":1592,"alt":18,"name":18,"focus":18,"title":18,"source":18,"filename":1593,"copyright":18,"fieldtype":1327,"meta_data":1594,"is_external_url":49},120918136024252,"/__replay/source/a.storyblok.com/f/337048/7111x4000/f6740c077e/ai3.jpg",{},"True AI-Native Architecture, Not AI Features","Competitors market AI as an add-on. Terminal is built ground-up as AI-native with computer vision at its core. That means unique capabilities like automated yard missions and anomaly alerts that others can’t replicate.",{"_uid":1598,"image":1599,"title":1603,"content":1604,"component":1580},"537c4ce4-6c03-4b75-bea9-cb34da6fdc52",{"id":1600,"alt":18,"name":18,"focus":18,"title":18,"source":18,"filename":1601,"copyright":18,"fieldtype":1327,"meta_data":1602,"is_external_url":49},120918136036541,"/__replay/source/a.storyblok.com/f/337048/4059x2682/f932538dc6/logistics-network2.jpg",{},"End-to-end Orchestration, Not Task Optimization","Most YMS tools optimize one function at a time.  Terminal coordinates every asset and workflow from gate to dock and back. If a truck is delayed, the system reroutes, reassigns, and alerts automatically — delivering orchestration competitors simply can’t match.",{"_uid":1606,"image":1607,"title":1611,"content":1612,"component":1580},"8ac66a00-edfb-4059-9e2a-861b091e44bb",{"id":1608,"alt":18,"name":18,"focus":18,"title":18,"source":18,"filename":1609,"copyright":18,"fieldtype":1327,"meta_data":1610,"is_external_url":49},120918135999668,"/__replay/source/a.storyblok.com/f/337048/4960x3507/b18d3261b8/ai7.jpg",{},"Cloud-Ready Deployments, Not IT-Heavy Rollouts","Traditional systems require costly hardware and long implementations. Terminal runs on a cloud-based infrastructure with lightweight hardware, pre-configured bundles, and a low IT lift. Deployments happen in days, not quarters.",[],"FeaturesGrid",{"id":1011,"url":18,"linktype":19,"fieldtype":20,"cached_url":1012},"LEARN MORE",{"_uid":1618,"label":1619,"stats":1620,"title":1634,"subtitle":18,"component":1645,"background_type":1469},"6dcdb804-4712-495b-9ef0-aa2e22c19a95","Value of Terminal Across Your Logistics Operation",[1621,1626,1630],{"_uid":1622,"value":1623,"component":1624,"description":1625,"value_suffix":18},"f20fc6f7-8f2e-468e-8683-23ce19e55bef","80%","ProofPointsStat","Reduction in driven check-in delays",{"_uid":1627,"value":1628,"component":1624,"description":1629,"value_suffix":18},"36d93bb9-4c35-4dba-90d7-329330c04d09","Up to 15%","Improvement in warehouse labor usage at the dock",{"_uid":1631,"value":1632,"component":1624,"description":1633,"value_suffix":18},"c34dadc8-d71f-4252-a254-bd0d58443182","10-15%","Reduction in logistics operating costs",{"type":66,"content":1635},[1636],{"type":112,"attrs":1637,"content":1638},{"textAlign":139},[1639],{"text":1640,"type":75,"marks":1641},"Terminal replaces outdated systems with limited yard visibility, fragmented tools driven by manual communication methods and poor data quality that hinders effective decision-making.",[1642],{"type":149,"attrs":1643},{"color":1644},"#1B1C1D","ProofPoints",{"_uid":1647,"items":1648,"title":1654,"component":1671},"279f9e20-53d8-4a71-aaf8-08f8d847449e",[1649,1650,1651,1652,1653],"adc7a8a1-ab68-4a55-b057-da1508a6b09e","ad6d4cfa-d643-4214-b4a8-b2b2e5922d48","7798d5c5-be05-4174-9f81-0884d9553d03","dabbcc36-7b3b-4ace-9547-94d075b54adc","a2be7678-6a49-469f-8004-0b9a71ad46c4",{"type":66,"content":1655},[1656],{"type":69,"attrs":1657,"conten