287},{"textAlign":139},[4288],{"text":4289,"type":75,"marks":4290},"The technology exists today to bridge operational and data gaps across your yard network. You can achieve rapid ROI in under five months while building a scalable infrastructure that grows with your business. The question isn't whether to modernize your yard operations—it's how quickly you can implement systems that give you the competitive edge in an increasingly demanding logistics landscape.’",[4291],{"type":149,"attrs":4292},{"color":2191},{"id":18,"url":18,"linktype":19,"fieldtype":20,"cached_url":18},[4295],"489dfeeb-71d3-4812-95bb-a398f19766eb","A Yard Management System (YMS) is essential for managing logistics yards. It helps coordinate the movement of trailers, assign docks, and oversee gate activities throughout your facility. You can think of it as the control center for traffic, ensuring everything runs smoothly in your yard. It keeps track of every asset from the moment it enters your premises until it leaves.",{"id":139,"alt":139,"name":18,"focus":139,"title":139,"source":139,"filename":18,"copyright":139,"fieldtype":1327,"meta_data":4298},{},"How a Yard Management System Enhances Visibility Across Multi-Site Operations",{"id":4301,"alt":18,"name":18,"focus":18,"title":18,"source":18,"filename":4302,"copyright":18,"fieldtype":1327,"meta_data":4303,"is_external_url":49},110545367713179,"/__replay/source/a.storyblok.com/f/337048/1700x1136/c5fcf11fd1/r.webp",{},[],"Discover how a modern yard management system delivers real-time visibility across multi-site operations—reducing blind spots, improving coordination, and keeping freight moving efficiently.",{"value":2656,"plugin":2657},"how-a-yard-management-system-enhances-real-time-visibility-across-multi-site-operations","all-resources/how-a-yard-management-system-enhances-real-time-visibility-across-multi-site-operations",-1060,[4311,4312,4313,4314],"automation in operations","efficiency ","metrics","technology","c84823c1-9494-4685-850f-e7